<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wilson and Horton posts don't sell notice.</title>
<headline>Wilson and Horton posts don't sell notice.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand publisher Wilson and Horton Ltd said on Monday it had posted a &quot;Don't Sell&quot; notice to shareholders following an announcement by Independent Press Communications that it was seeking all outstanding W&amp;H shares.</p>
</text>
